docs {
  Recent API activity, newest first: every request members made against the workspace, with route, status code, duration and any error message. Omit workspace_id to read every workspace the caller belongs to plus their own account-level requests. `summary` carries totals and hourly buckets for the whole filtered window. Rows are kept for 30 days.

  Requires the `workspaces` scope when using an API key.

  **Scope:** `workspaces`
}
